@startuml Combo Package Management
title Combo Package Management Sequence

actor User
participant LWC as "nexusComboPackageManager"
participant Controller as "ComboPackageController"
participant Database as "Salesforce DB"

== Load Packages ==
User -> LWC: Open Combo Package Manager
LWC -> Controller: getAllPackages()
Controller -> Database: SELECT FROM ComboPackage__c WITH SECURITY_ENFORCED
Database --> Controller: Package data + items
Controller --> LWC: PackageWrapper[]
LWC --> User: Display packages

== Create Package ==
User -> LWC: Click "New Package"
LWC --> User: Show editor form
User -> LWC: Fill package details + select products
LWC -> Controller: savePackage(packageJson)
Controller -> Database: INSERT ComboPackage__c
Controller -> Database: INSERT ComboPackageItem__c[]
Database --> Controller: Success
Controller --> LWC: Package ID
LWC --> User: Success message + refresh list

== Delete Package ==
User -> LWC: Click delete on package
LWC -> Controller: deletePackage(packageId)
Controller -> Database: DELETE ComboPackageItem__c WHERE ComboPackage__c = :id
Controller -> Database: DELETE ComboPackage__c WHERE Id = :id
Database --> Controller: Success
Controller --> LWC: Success
LWC --> User: Refresh list

== Toggle Active Status ==
User -> LWC: Toggle active/inactive
LWC -> Controller: togglePackageActive(packageId, isActive)
Controller -> Database: UPDATE ComboPackage__c SET IsActive__c = :isActive
Database --> Controller: Success
Controller --> LWC: Success
LWC --> User: Update UI status
@enduml